      "position": 0,
      "title": "Introduction: Nonconforming Parts",
      "videoId": "01M32FETCRYGKXFK6GYR000FM8",
      "duration": 42.2,
      "description": "Nonconforming Parts\nNonconforming parts shall be separated and placed in the non-conforming area.\nSeparate non-conforming parts from good parts by putting the non-conforming parts in the plastic container found on the ground below the inspection table.\nWhen the work order is finished, take these non-conforming parts to the non-conforming area.\nThe non-conforming area is located behind the Girasol workstations.",
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 0.74,
          "end": 2.68,
          "text": "Nonconforming Parts"
        },
        {
          "start": 4.03,
          "end": 8.74,
          "text": "Nonconforming parts shall be separated and placed in the non-conforming area."
        },
        {
          "start": 11.14,
          "end": 19.6,
          "text": "Separate non-conforming parts from good parts by putting the non-conforming parts in the plastic container found on the ground below the inspection table."
        },
        {
          "start": 21.64,
          "end": 27.54,
          "text": "When the work order is finished, take these non-conforming parts to the non-conforming area."
        },
        {
          "start": 28.5,
          "end": 33.18,
          "text": "The non-conforming area is located behind the Girasol workstations."
